{"product_id":"the-strange-case-of-dr-jekyll-and-mr-hyde-headline-review-classics","title":"The Strange Case of Dr.Jekyll and Mr.Hyde (Headline Review Classics)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLawyer Gabriel Utterson has heard of an ambiguous, solitary, and violent man called Edward Hyde who is said to have trampled a young girl in the streets of London. Utterson becomes concerned when a friend of his, Dr. Henry Jekyll, makes a will declaring that in the event of his death or disappearance, Hyde should inherit all his property. When Hyde is seen murdering a respected political figure, Jekyll becomes increasingly reclusive, which leads Utterson to suspect that there is more than a casual connection between his friend and this brutal monster of a man.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Robert Louis Stevenson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755338856\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 21\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595424370841,"sku":"2RC9780755338856","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-strange-case-of-drjekyll-and-mrhyde-headline-review-classics-786069.jpg?v=1694792491","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-strange-case-of-dr-jekyll-and-mr-hyde-headline-review-classics","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}